                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "44de04e3-e647-37c0-b794-096a1212014c",
                        "entry_id": "b389a4a8-2277-3ffb-978f-9433c22eaede",
                        "glosses": [
                            "свойство по значению прилагательного ворсистый; наличие ворса, ворсинок на поверхности чего-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2a18352f-a663-4958-9d63-a635bfe4db40",
                                "sense_id": "44de04e3-e647-37c0-b794-096a1212014c",
                                "text": "Если бы он погиб, его босые ноги не могли бы ощущать жёсткую ворсистость ковра."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "871f92db-a002-44de-aa78-291d6c03825b",
                                "sense_id": "44de04e3-e647-37c0-b794-096a1212014c",
                                "text": "Он появился в своей плотно плетённой шерстяной шапочке, лицом — копия Льва Толстого, включая бороду, нос картошкой и брови такой же ворсистости."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d6e141c5-e2cb-40e3-a002-e0cb48f95bbc",
                        "source_entry_id": "b389a4a8-2277-3ffb-978f-9433c22eaede",
                        "source_sense_id": "44de04e3-e647-37c0-b794-096a1212014c",
                        "target_lang_word": "fluffiness",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fluffiness",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "92f02792-cedd-3c83-ac24-33d45afc82e5",
                                        "entry_id": "dc0e3f71-fc66-3980-9077-13c648644269",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The characteristic or quality of being fluffy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "54d40857-b040-4e33-ab73-e775bc5a2b70",
                                                "sense_id": "92f02792-cedd-3c83-ac24-33d45afc82e5",
                                                "text": "For five minutes Pollyanna worked swiftly, deftly, combing a refractory curl into fluffiness, perking up a drooping ruffle at the neck, or shaking a pillow into plumpness so that the head might have a better pose. Meanwhile the sick woman, frowning prodigiously, and openly scoffing at the whole procedure, was, in spite of herself, beginning to tingle with a feeling perilously near to excitement."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f1184f7b-3761-4f6c-9b32-78c6a3e7a3d1",
                        "source_entry_id": "b389a4a8-2277-3ffb-978f-9433c22eaede",
                        "source_sense_id": "44de04e3-e647-37c0-b794-096a1212014c",
                        "target_lang_word": "hairiness",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hairiness",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ef4d5fb9-f06d-33ba-b21f-e0e8b8cbfca3",
                                        "entry_id": "7d467b3d-6378-36db-a506-16a268a65a3b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The characteristic of being hairy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "172d5820-4cab-43e1-8091-9ff1a72c5933",
                                                "sense_id": "ef4d5fb9-f06d-33ba-b21f-e0e8b8cbfca3",
                                                "text": "1665, Robert Hooke, Micrographia, Observ. XXVI,\nWe have had (says he) another of this kind brought us out of the East-Indies, which being planted was in shew like the former, but came not to perfection, the unkindly season not suffering it to shew the flower; but of the Cods that were brought, some were smaller, shorter, and rounder then the Garden kind; others much longer, and many growing together, as it were in clusters, and cover'd all over with a brown short hairiness, so fine, that if any of it be rubb'd, or fall on the back of ones hand, or other tender parts of the skin, it will cause a kind of itching […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c3e89d4f-8e32-4eb1-a1c6-b0a1d3c08e14",
                                                "sense_id": "ef4d5fb9-f06d-33ba-b21f-e0e8b8cbfca3",
                                                "text": "The fore-feet of the Yahoo differed from my hands in nothing else but the length of the nails, the coarseness and brownness of the palms, and the hairiness on the backs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c56559a9-42fc-4fa6-902f-c91e64b1bf2e",
                                                "sense_id": "ef4d5fb9-f06d-33ba-b21f-e0e8b8cbfca3",
                                                "text": "Spanberg, the Russian navigator, landed, he says, in a great island from 43° to 50° lat., speaks of the uncommon hairiness of the natives, and of their wearing of silver in their ears."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e0e06b8b-4a64-4a5d-881c-87c5cc3cc763",
                                                "sense_id": "ef4d5fb9-f06d-33ba-b21f-e0e8b8cbfca3",
                                                "text": "Small reddened but said stubbornly, “The cow likes my singing.” ¶ Cows are different from humans; perhaps the hairiness of their ears strains sound."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "56f8ca29-d2e0-3052-90b5-948085769227",
                                        "entry_id": "7d467b3d-6378-36db-a506-16a268a65a3b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A characteristic of yarn: the proportion of fibre ends that stick out and are not embedded in the yarn body."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6379342c-6dbe-4cf6-859c-72f3480f72b6",
                                                "sense_id": "56f8ca29-d2e0-3052-90b5-948085769227",
                                                "text": "There was a reduction in hairiness of yarn after warping by about 17% in comparison to the hairiness of the wound yarn."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4005e4af-bc17-44c9-88fe-12e20549c11c",
                        "source_entry_id": "b389a4a8-2277-3ffb-978f-9433c22eaede",
                        "source_sense_id": "44de04e3-e647-37c0-b794-096a1212014c",
                        "target_lang_word": "vellosidad",
